  "description": "So many other stocks to choose from...that aren't DEAD WEIGHT 💀",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to <strong>StockTok</strong></em>! In our quiet day off from the Stock Market, I wanted to see which stock was getting a lot of online chatter. <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$AMD&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> was the ticker that came up…a stock I shorted a few times in 2024. </p><p><strong>Can AMD go up?</strong> Sure.  <strong>Can AMD defy the odds and go to the moon?</strong> Possibly. But right now…nothing is giving me much conviction in that. </p><p>Personal opinion: there are literally hundreds of other tickers that provide far greater opportunity. Just because something is “popular” does not necessarily guarantee you profit. We talked about a dozen different tickers in <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-livestream-18-june?r=4z8lgl\">last night’s livestream with far greater potential!</a></p><p>As always, do what is best for you. Questions are always welcome in the chat. Thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><div><hr></div><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a> </strong></em></p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
